OL,3,ABessent blames Lutnick's Commerce
OL,4,ADepartment for failing to block
OL,5,AMegaspeed
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent has
OL,8,Fblamed the Commerce Department, run by
OL,9,FHoward Lutnick, of failing to properly
OL,10,Foversee the export of
OL,11,Fhigh-specification Nvidia chips, as the
OL,12,Ffallout from the scandal widens.
OL,14,FJensen Huang left the company he
OL,15,Fco-founded after revelations he had an
OL,16,Faffair a former Megaspeed executive.
OL,17,FThe firm had been buying advanced chips
OL,18,Ffrom Nvidia.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
