OL,3,ABessent blames Lutnick's Commerce
OL,4,ADepartment for failing to block
OL,5,AMegaspeed
OL,6,
OL,7,FMegaspeed had been probed by US
OL,8,Fgovernment agencies over suspicions it
OL,9,Fhad been smuggling those chips into
OL,10,FChina, reports said, but it is not on a
OL,11,Flist of firms that US companies are
OL,12,Fprevented from working with.
OL,14,FBessent told CNBC several government
OL,15,Fagencies "were in favour of putting
OL,16,FMegaspeed on the entity list for
OL,17,Fmonths".
